---
const { contactEmail } = Astro.props;
const officialGsaAuctionsUrl = 'https://www.gsaauctions.gov/';
const lottieLicenseUrl = 'https://lottiefiles.com/page/license';
---

<div class="legal-content">
  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Agreement</h2>
    <p>
      These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of GSA Auction Finder (the
      "App" or "Service"). By downloading, accessing, or using the App, you agree
      to these Terms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Purpose and Independent Status</h2>
    <p>
      The App helps users discover public GSA Auctions listings, search and filter
      auction information, save listings and searches, keep personal notes, compare
      listings, create reminders, and open official listing pages.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App is an independent auction-discovery tool. It is not affiliated with,
      endorsed by, sponsored by, or operated by the U.S. General Services
      Administration or the United States Government.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App does not place bids, accept payments for auction property, sell
      property, guarantee purchases, arrange inspections, arrange shipping, or
      arrange pickup. Bid, Buy, and similar actions open official GSA Auctions
      pages or other external services.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Official Transactions and Verification</h2>
    <p>
      Auction information in the App is provided for convenience and informational
      purposes only. You are responsible for verifying listing details, sale
      method, eligibility, property condition, reserve information, deposits, fees,
      deadlines, payment rules, inspection requirements, removal requirements, and
      pickup details through the official listing before bidding, buying, traveling,
      or relying on the information.
    </p>
    <p>
      Official auction information is available through
      <a href={officialGsaAuctionsUrl}>GSA Auctions</a>. If there is any conflict
      between the App and an official listing, the official listing controls.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Auction Data, Photos, and Availability</h2>
    <p>
      Listings, prices, bidder counts, bid history, countdowns, documents, photos,
      contact fields, and auction status may be delayed, incomplete, inaccurate,
      unavailable, changed, removed, or cached. Offline or cached content can be
      stale. We do not guarantee that every listing, image, document, price, alert,
      or status shown in the App is current, complete, or available.
    </p>
    <p>
      Official listing links, agency pages, photos, documents, maps, phone links,
      email links, calendar tools, browser pages, and sharing tools may open or
      depend on third-party or platform services outside our control.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Maps, ZIP Distances, and Calendar Reminders</h2>
    <p>
      ZIP-area distances, map pins, directions, and location estimates are
      approximate. They are not confirmed coordinates, routes, access instructions,
      pickup instructions, or travel advice. Always verify property location,
      inspection, pickup, removal, and access requirements through official sources.
    </p>
    <p>
      Calendar reminders are convenience tools. Events you create may not update
      automatically when a listing changes and may remain in your calendar after
      you remove a listing or uninstall the App.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Alerts, Saved Content, and Local Data</h2>
    <p>
      Alerts and notifications are best effort. They may be delayed, missed,
      duplicated, incomplete, or affected by device settings, platform limits,
      background refresh, network availability, app state, and data-source changes.
      You remain responsible for monitoring official listing pages and deadlines.
    </p>
    <p>
      Saved listings, saved searches, ZIP locations, personal notes, comparison
      state, alert history, and related records are stored on your device. The App
      does not currently provide app-managed cloud sync or recovery for that data.
      You are responsible for maintaining any records you need.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Free Features and Pro Subscriptions</h2>
    <p>
      Browsing, searching, filtering, saved listings, saved searches, saved ZIP
      locations, comparisons, calendar reminders, and one active saved-search alert
      are available without Pro. Pro expands saved-search alerts, enables
      saved-listing change and ending alerts, and removes ads while your
      subscription is active.
    </p>
    <p>
      Free alert capacity and Pro alert capacity may differ by platform or release.
      If Pro expires, extra alerts may pause while saved records remain on your
      device. Stored listing and search counts are not subscription-limited.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Subscription Billing, Cancellation, and Restoration</h2>
    <p>
      Subscriptions are billed by the Apple App Store or Google Play, depending on
      where you subscribed. Prices, renewal timing, taxes, trials, cancellation
      rules, refund handling, and payment processing are managed by the applicable
      store and your store account.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can manage or cancel subscriptions through the store account that handled
      the purchase. Uninstalling the App does not cancel a subscription. Restore
      purchases uses the same platform account. Purchases do not transfer between
      Apple and Google store accounts.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Acceptable Use and Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      You may use the App only for lawful purposes and in compliance with
      applicable laws, auction rules, platform rules, and these Terms. You agree not
      to misuse the App, interfere with normal operation, attempt unauthorized
      access, scrape in a way that burdens services, or use the App to violate
      official auction terms.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App's design, code, branding, and original content are protected by
      applicable intellectual property laws. Government data, agency names,
      trademarks, auction listings, photos, and documents remain the property of
      their respective owners. Animation assets may be subject to the
      <a href={lottieLicenseUrl}>LottieFiles license</a> or other third-party
      licenses where used.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Disclaimers and Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      The App is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties
      of any kind, express or implied, including warranties of merchantability,
      fitness for a particular purpose, non-infringement, availability, accuracy,
      completeness, and uninterrupted operation.
    </p>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect,
      incidental, special, consequential, exemplary, or punitive damages, or for
      lost profits, lost opportunities, missed bids, missed deadlines, travel costs,
      pickup costs, inspection costs, removal costs, data loss, or reliance on
      auction information shown in the App.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>Changes and Contact</h2>
    <p>
      We may revise these Terms as features, platform requirements, or legal needs
      change. When we do, we will update the effective date shown above. Continued
      use of the App after updated Terms take effect means you accept the revised
      Terms.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at
      <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
